# Optional Desk settings, read at build time (see docs/observability.md). Copy to .env.local and uncomment what you need.
# Every key is optional: a missing or invalid key switches that integration off, and an off
# integration downloads nothing. These values end up in the browser bundle, so only public keys
# belong here. Never put SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN in this file (it is a deploy-only secret).

# Sentry error reporting. The DSN from your Sentry project's Client Keys page.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://<public-key>@o<org-id>.ingest.sentry.io/<project-id>
# Release name to tag events with (the deploy job uses the commit SHA).
# VITE_SENTRY_RELEASE=<release>
# Environment label; defaults to the Vite mode (development or production).
# VITE_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=<environment>
# Share of page loads traced, a number from 0 to 1; defaults to 0.05.
# VITE_SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=0.05

# PostHog product analytics, only for users who opt in. The project API key.
# VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_replace_me
# PostHog ingest host, https only; defaults to https://us.i.posthog.com.
# VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
